 and Sustainability) as well as the UAE Pavilion and Al Wasl Plaza. Each site features a brief explanation courtesy of one of the mascot characters. After visiting each and meeting their new friends, players will be notified of their completion: they're now ready to explore the real (or virtual) site come October 2020!", "short_description": "Meet the Expo 2020 Dubai mascots and explore the futuristic site of the upcoming event in Expo 2020 Explorer!"}]}, "developer_name": "Magnopus", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.expo2020dubai.com/expo-explorer", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.expo2020dubai.com/expo-explorer", "publisher_name": "Expo 2020", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.expo2020dubai.com/en", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "TRAVEL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "298923405444008"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223480_3439050352773551_1531269584642899968_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y35sX7yeTGIQ7kNvwEo5PjG&_nc_oc=Ado_XA-lKpdSYHlQjdq2gu1bmMrwzjZKsj_80KCIwOeIGgLeRxOnAZQh2UQOeMbjzF0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUt5rTVi9QhxMtbVzbPdjF1mvS_3XG2M8K-qPuhifx31Q&oe=6B10424E"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Expo 2020 Explorer", "platform": "AND